{"id": 1008466, "slug": "loan-shark-2", "name": "Loan Shark", "name_original": "Loan Shark", "description": "<p><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><h3>Features</h3><ul><li><p><strong>A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror game about debt and hopelessness.</strong> Enjoy a twisted cautionary tale in one sitting.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Underwater eye-cam. </strong>Watch the fish biting the lure, then retrieve it as fast as you can. Be careful though: something else may be watching you as well...</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Fish and gut</strong>. Fly-fish like a pro, then gut your catch to keep 'em fresh. Be careful with the knife though: you don't want to cut yourself.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>The talking fish wants a deal</strong>. Consider the alluring promises of this mysterious being through surreal dialogues and twisted choices.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>The loan shark is coming</strong>. This is no relaxing cozy fishing experience. Your time is running out, and something horrible lurks in the water.</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-08-08", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-03-02T02:31:26", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3e1/3e1c601d5dbbda7006e91d72473fbdb9.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f3f/f3f79182eebd56330483ede3cabeef12.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 4, "added_by_status": {"owned": 1, "beaten": 2, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "